#: ../../index.md:1
msgid "Lugha Reference API"
msgstr "I-API Yereferensi ye-Lugha"

#: ../../index.md:3
msgid ""
"Lugha is a small text generation API that supports African languages. Use"
" it to generate text, count tokens before you send a request, and choose "
"the region that processes your data."
msgstr ""
"I-Lugha iyi-API encane yokukhiqiza umbhalo esekela izilimi zase-Afrika. "
"Yisebenzise ukukhiqiza umbhalo, ukubala amathokheni ngaphambi kokuthumela "
"isicelo, nokukhetha isifunda esicutungula idatha yakho."

#: ../../index.md:5
msgid "Independent documentation exercise"
msgstr "Umsebenzi ozimele wokubhala imibhalo"

#: ../../index.md:8
msgid ""
"Lugha is not a real product. It is a reference API written to show how I "
"document an AI inference service for developers. The model is a stub that"
" returns predictable text, so every example on these pages runs and "
"returns exactly what is shown."
msgstr ""
"I-Lugha akuwona umkhiqizo wangempela. Iyi-API yereferensi ebhalwe ukuze "
"ibonise ukuthi ngibhala kanjani imibhalo yensizakalo ye-AI inference "
"yabathuthukisi. Imodeli iyi-stub ebuyisa umbhalo obikezelwayo, ngakho "
"zonke izibonelo kula makhasi ziyasebenza futhi zibuyisa lokho okubonisiwe."

#: ../../index.md:11
msgid "Start here"
msgstr "Qala lapha"

#: ../../index.md:16
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "Ukuqala ngokushesha"

#: ../../index.md:20
msgid "Make your first request in about five minutes."
msgstr "Yenza isicelo sakho sokuqala cishe emizuzwini emihlanu."

#: ../../index.md:23
msgid "Handle errors"
msgstr "Phatha amaphutha"

#: ../../index.md:27
msgid ""
"Every error has a type, a message and a request ID. Learn what to do with"
" each one."
msgstr ""
"Iphutha ngalinye linohlobo, umlayezo kanye ne-ID yesicelo. Funda ukuthi "
"ungenzani ngalinye."

#: ../../index.md:30
msgid "Go to production"
msgstr "Yiya ekukhiqizeni"

#: ../../index.md:34
msgid "A checklist to work through before you ship."
msgstr "Uhlu lokuhlola okufanele ululandele ngaphambi kokukhipha umkhiqizo."

#: ../../index.md:37
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "Ireferensi ye-API"

#: ../../index.md:41
msgid "Every endpoint, parameter and response."
msgstr "Yonke i-endpoint, ipharamitha nempendulo."